  <section class="wrap fiche-body">
    <div>
      <h2>The vibe</h2>
      <p>Au Poil Frivole, on rue Frédéric Mireur in Draguignan, has been around for nearly 30 years (2 consistent sources) and offers grooming well beyond the classic dog: cats, mice, ferrets, rabbits, with clipping, English-style trimming, show cuts and nail/ear/anal gland care. Wheelchair access on site.</p>

      <h2>What to know before you go</h2>
      <p>The salon can be reached on 04 94 68 71 55. Map directories (Mappy, OpenStreetMap) show opening Monday to Saturday, 7:30am to 7pm, and closing on Sunday; these hours don't come from the salon itself and need to be confirmed. No official website or price list was found. One isolated review mentions a refusal for large breeds, whereas an aggregated review summary says on the contrary that the groomer looks after dogs of all sizes: this point remains contradictory, and it is best to state your dog's size by phone before coming.</p>
      <div class="callout">Coco's tip: a quick call before booking saves you an unpleasant surprise, especially with a large dog.</div>

      <h2>Nearby</h2>
      <p>Rue Frédéric Mireur is in the centre of Draguignan, a few steps from boulevard Maréchal Foch, so you can extend the outing with your dog on a leash after the appointment.</p>
